[size=5][b]Expanded Storage / 仓库扩容[/b][/size]

[b]Keep every rare drop.[/b] Raises your home Storage to [b]1000 slots[/b] (configurable 400-1000) without touching Butch's quests, donations or rewards.
[b]稀有掉落再也不用扔。[/b]把家里的仓库提升到 [b]1000 格[/b]（可设 400-1000），不影响 Butch 的任务、捐猫和奖励。

[size=4][b]Strongly recommended / 强烈推荐[/b][/size]
[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/mewgenics/mods/526]Improved Inventory[/url] by anitosq: scrolling grids, search and filters keep a huge Storage readable. Not bundled; please download it from the author's page.
anitosq 的 [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/mewgenics/mods/526]Improved Inventory[/url]：滚动网格、搜索和筛选。本模组不打包它，请到作者页面下载。

[size=4][b]Features / 功能[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Up to 1000 Storage slots, set in ExpandedStorage.ini / 最多 1000 格，可在 ini 中设置
[*]Existing and new saves; choose which slots / 支持新旧存档，可指定槽位
[*]Butch's progression untouched; donation-cost mods still work / 不改 Butch 进度，捐猫类模组照常生效
[*]Your save keeps 400 slots even without the mod / 没有模组时存档也保留 400 格
[*]Exact version check with a warning on game updates / 严格版本校验，游戏更新时弹窗提醒
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements / 前置[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Mewgenics Steam build 25143593 (1.1.21239), Windows x64
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/mewgenics/mods/218]Mewjector[/url] (API v3)
[*]Mewtator (recommended / 推荐)
[/list]

[size=4][b]⚠ Read before playing without the mod / 不加载模组前必读[/b][/size]
The game itself supports only 400 slots. Whenever this mod is not active (disabled, launched without Mewtator, after a game update), Storage falls back to 400 and [b]items beyond 400 are moved to the Trash[/b] when you enter your home. Bring Storage down to 400 items before uninstalling.
游戏本身只支持 400 格。只要本模组没有生效（被禁用、不通过 Mewtator 启动、游戏更新后），仓库回到 400 格，进入家园时[b]超过 400 件的物品会被移入垃圾桶[/b]。卸载前请先降到 400 件以内。

[size=4][b]Compatibility / 兼容性[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Improved Inventory 0.3.7: tested together. Its 1024-item limit counts Storage + Trash. / 已实测；1024 上限为仓库 + 垃圾桶合计。
[*]Bigger Storage Early / donation mods: designed to be compatible. / 设计上兼容。
[*]Other mods patching the same Storage limit: this mod stays off. / 其他改同一上限的模组：本模组自动停用。
[/list]

[size=4][b]Credits / 致谢[/b][/size]
anitosq (Improved Inventory, MIT), Mewjector Contributors (MIT), SanTertrust (mgmp research notes, MIT).

[size=4][b]Source & License / 源码与许可[/b][/size]
MIT. Source code, build instructions and technical notes on GitHub: https://github.com/sans2725/mewgenics-expanded-storage
